      "from": 563,
      "voice": "user",
      "text": "Ehem… beli kopi susu dua puluh delapan ribu pakai GoPay, terus… bayar parkir tiga ribu pakai cash.",
      "style": "Say this in casual Indonesian at a quick, natural pace, like someone dictating expenses to their phone. Start with a short throat clear. After \"terus\", let out one short, annoyed sigh (nobody likes paying for parking), then finish the sentence a bit resigned. Do not add any words:"
